  "body": "The M+ variants of the 770M and 1100M.\n\nHub (PathPilot v2.14.4, 2026-11-09) lists this model under Current Machine Models. CamCraft does not ship it yet. Requested by the contributor so every Hub machine can be selected and Hub-tested.\n\n**Done means:** both ship as Tormach mills with their manual's travels, rpm range(s), power, feeds and tool count, and they post with the PathPilot (tormach) post.\n\nSpecs come from Tormach's operator manual for the model, its specifications table (contributor-supplied; cite the manual number and section in the decision file), clean-room. Same conventions as the shipped Tormach machines: inch, full-stroke-either-way travel, and a `tormach_machines`-style spec test.\n",
